<title>USA: TABLE-Quezon Power sells $215 mln Yankee debt.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Quezon Power sells $215 mln Yankee debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Yankee debt issue from Quezon Power (Philippines) Ltd Co was priced on Monday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $12 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER QUEZON POWER</p>
<p>AMT $215 MLN	  COUPON 8.86 PCT   MATURITY 6/15/2017</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SECD NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S Ba1    YIELD 8.959 PCT   PAY FREQ QUARTERLY</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BB-plus    SPREAD 245 BP     CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1672))</p>
</text>
